          "name": "Key",
          "type": "FPersistentShadowStateKey&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UInt",
      "docs": "Stores info about sorted lights and ranges.\nThe sort-key in FSortedLightSceneInfo gives rise to the following order:\n[SimpleLights,Clustered,UnbatchedLights,LumenLights]\nNote that some shadowed lights can be included in the clustered pass when virtual shadow maps and one pass projection are used."
